{
  "$schema": "../recipe.schema.json",
  "id": "egov-population-dataset-search",
  "contract_version": "1.1.0",
  "title": {
    "ja": "e-Govで人口データセットを特定する",
    "en": "Locate a population dataset in e-Gov"
  },
  "question": {
    "ja": "e-Govデータポータルで人口に関する公開データセットを特定できるか。",
    "en": "Can we locate a public dataset about population in the e-Gov Data Portal?"
  },
  "source_id": "egov-data-portal",
  "request": {
    "method": "GET",
    "url": "https://data.e-gov.go.jp/data/api/action/package_search?fq=name%3Asoumu_20140909_0581&rows=1&start=0",
    "allowed_hosts": ["data.e-gov.go.jp"],
    "headers": {
      "Accept": "application/json"
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "status": 200,
    "content_type_contains": "application/json",
    "max_bytes": 500000,
    "assertions": [
      {
        "pointer": "/success",
        "equals": true
      },
      {
        "pointer": "/result/count",
        "equals": 1
      },
      {
        "pointer": "/result/results",
        "min_length": 1
      },
      {
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/id",
        "equals": "64d9dbbe-640a-4d83-b647-242842870761"
      },
      {
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/resources",
        "min_length": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "result": {
    "fields": [
      {
        "name": "match-count",
        "label": {
          "ja": "検索一致件数",
          "en": "Matching datasets"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/count",
        "unit": "件"
      },
      {
        "name": "dataset-id",
        "label": {
          "ja": "データセットID",
          "en": "Dataset ID"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/id"
      },
      {
        "name": "dataset-name",
        "label": {
          "ja": "データセット名",
          "en": "Dataset name"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/title"
      },
      {
        "name": "publisher",
        "label": {
          "ja": "提供者",
          "en": "Publisher"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/publisher"
      },
      {
        "name": "metadata-modified",
        "label": {
          "ja": "メタデータ更新日時",
          "en": "Metadata modified"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/metadata_modified"
      },
      {
        "name": "resource-format",
        "label": {
          "ja": "先頭リソース形式",
          "en": "First resource format"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/resources/0/format"
      },
      {
        "name": "resource-url",
        "label": {
          "ja": "先頭リソースURL",
          "en": "First resource URL"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/resources/0/url"
      },
      {
        "name": "resource-license-id",
        "label": {
          "ja": "先頭リソースのライセンスID",
          "en": "First resource license ID"
        },
        "pointer": "/result/results/0/resources/0/license_id"
      }
    ]
  },
  "interpretation": [
    "これはe-Govデータポータル上の安定したデータセット名で絞り込んだカタログ結果であり、個別データの値そのものではありません。",
    "返されたリソースURLへ進む前に、形式、更新日、リソース単位のライセンスと提供元の条件を確認してください。",
    "データセットやリソースは更新、移動、公開終了になる場合があり、その場合はこのレシピの識別子assertionが失敗します。"
  ],
  "attribution": {
    "source_url": "https://data.e-gov.go.jp/data/ja/api_guide",
    "license_url": "https://www.digital.go.jp/resources/open_data/public_data_license_v1.0",
    "credit": "出典：e-Govデータポータル（https://data.e-gov.go.jp/）"
  },
  "last_verified": "2026-08-02"
}
